1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:15,260
I don't want nobody to get killed

2
00:00:15,260 --> 00:00:22,780
I come and get you, I'm always ready to fight

3
00:00:24,780 --> 00:00:29,140
So don't take all of the blame where all is spread

4
00:00:29,140 --> 00:00:32,860
Oh, I don't take all of the blame, you always do

5
00:00:32,860 --> 00:00:36,620
It will always be something you cannot control

6
00:00:36,620 --> 00:00:40,880
We will overcome, your salvation has begun

7
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:46,240
No sun, no light, such a mess, I'm over

8
00:00:46,240 --> 00:00:54,860
Don't kill your walls, you make me realize who I need

9
00:00:54,860 --> 00:00:59,660
I'll be there, hold on, the changes in power

10
00:00:59,660 --> 00:01:02,540
So where are you now?

11
00:01:03,120 --> 00:01:07,280
I'll reach you, my top, the shadows of the earth

12
00:01:07,280 --> 00:01:10,340
Illusions apart

13
00:01:10,340 --> 00:01:14,580
The golden end is still wrong, but the lowest

14
00:01:14,580 --> 00:01:19,080
The pain that makes us too human after all

15
00:01:19,080 --> 00:01:22,160
Don't want to see before the good show

16
00:01:22,160 --> 00:01:24,040
About the precious one

17
00:01:24,040 --> 00:01:27,520
This car may respond to the call

18
00:01:27,520 --> 00:01:57,500
Don't come up

19
00:01:57,500 --> 00:01:59,220
From under here, no matter what

20
00:01:59,220 --> 00:02:03,720
Wait, sister

21
00:02:03,720 --> 00:02:21,040
Hey, Lakis, headquarters is checking in

22
00:02:21,040 --> 00:02:21,980
They want an update

23
00:02:21,980 --> 00:02:24,540
Now of all times

24
00:02:24,540 --> 00:02:26,140
It figures

25
00:02:26,140 --> 00:02:32,260
It's always when I'm in the middle of eating

26
00:02:32,260 --> 00:02:43,980
No, this can't be happening

27
00:02:43,980 --> 00:02:50,780
So, here we are, Yuichi

28
00:02:50,780 --> 00:02:54,040
Reliving your most traumatic memory and detail

29
00:02:54,040 --> 00:02:56,180
Right down to the blood splatters on the floor

30
00:02:56,180 --> 00:02:59,880
Tomoe, you're alive

31
00:02:59,880 --> 00:03:06,900
Because of you, she's dead now

32
00:03:06,900 --> 00:03:17,600
Is that you, brother?

33
00:03:18,860 --> 00:03:20,020
I'm sorry, Mirai

34
00:03:20,020 --> 00:03:21,540
I didn't mean to wake you up

35
00:03:21,540 --> 00:03:23,000
You didn't

36
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:26,520
How are you feeling?

37
00:03:27,180 --> 00:03:28,240
Not too bad

38
00:03:28,240 --> 00:03:30,460
I think it's gonna be a good day for us

39
00:03:30,460 --> 00:03:31,280
I do, too

40
00:03:31,280 --> 00:03:34,420
I bet you're hungry

41
00:03:34,420 --> 00:03:36,620
How about I scrounge up something for you to eat?

42
00:03:36,880 --> 00:03:37,120
Okay?

43
00:03:38,900 --> 00:03:42,280
Brother, why don't you leave me here to fend for myself

44
00:03:42,280 --> 00:03:44,100
So you can move on with your life

45
00:03:44,100 --> 00:03:45,440
Don't start with this

46
00:03:45,440 --> 00:03:46,940
Taking care of you is my duty

47
00:03:46,940 --> 00:03:50,700
But if things don't change, you'll end up dead, too

48
00:03:50,700 --> 00:03:51,640
No buts, Mirai

49
00:03:51,640 --> 00:03:53,520
I'm gonna make sure we both survive

50
00:03:53,520 --> 00:03:55,400
You don't mean that

51
00:03:55,400 --> 00:03:56,260
Not really

52
00:03:56,260 --> 00:03:58,240
At night, I hear you cry

53
00:03:58,240 --> 00:04:00,320
About how much you want to leave

54
00:04:00,320 --> 00:04:02,040
You've grown to hate me

55
00:04:02,040 --> 00:04:04,440
You wish I'd just die already

56
00:04:04,440 --> 00:04:06,760
Why?

57
00:04:07,400 --> 00:04:08,820
Why would you say that?

58
00:04:10,560 --> 00:04:12,940
Because despite how noble you try to be

59
00:04:12,940 --> 00:04:14,560
Deep down, you're a selfish human

60
00:04:14,560 --> 00:04:15,980
Who only thinks of himself

61
00:04:15,980 --> 00:04:18,380
Isn't that right, Shioka Mizuki?

62
00:04:18,660 --> 00:04:19,820
Now I get it

63
00:04:19,820 --> 00:04:21,080
You're the demon

64
00:04:21,080 --> 00:04:22,640
Bingo

65
00:04:22,640 --> 00:04:24,900
But I was right about your thoughts, wasn't I?

66
00:04:25,180 --> 00:04:26,700
I've seen every shameful thing

67
00:04:26,700 --> 00:04:28,280
That's floated through your little brain

68
00:04:28,280 --> 00:04:30,180
I wonder what your sister would say

69
00:04:30,180 --> 00:04:31,180
If she knew the truth

70
00:04:31,180 --> 00:04:32,440
Shut the hell up

71
00:04:32,440 --> 00:04:34,080
Interesting

72
00:04:34,080 --> 00:04:40,440
At least one of them appears to be putting up a fight

73
00:04:40,440 --> 00:04:59,480
It's good to see you

74
00:05:01,180 --> 00:05:08,020
Even if you did run off and leave us to die with the vampires

75
00:05:08,020 --> 00:05:12,100
It's not a good idea to imitate people I care about

76
00:05:12,100 --> 00:05:13,180
Well then

77
00:05:13,180 --> 00:05:16,600
I thought I'd be able to shake you up by touching on a sore spot

78
00:05:16,600 --> 00:05:19,720
But you don't appear the least bit rattled

79
00:05:19,720 --> 00:05:21,940
Now I wonder, why is that?

80
00:05:22,480 --> 00:05:24,860
You're not the first demon who's tried to mess with my head

81
00:05:24,860 --> 00:05:27,620
So just cut the crap and hand over your power already

82
00:05:27,620 --> 00:05:28,620
Mika

83
00:05:28,620 --> 00:05:28,880
Mika

84
00:05:28,880 --> 00:05:32,880
Mika

85
00:05:32,880 --> 00:05:53,820
Oh, I see what's going on

86
00:05:53,820 --> 00:05:56,680
You managed to defeat a low-ranking demon like Mio

87
00:05:56,680 --> 00:06:00,660
And now you think you've got what it takes to tame a being with actual power

88
00:06:00,660 --> 00:06:03,920
I could possess your heart and mind without the slightest effort

89
00:06:03,920 --> 00:06:05,400
You talk big

90
00:06:05,400 --> 00:06:07,960
But I'm not giving up until I've got a contract with you

91
00:06:07,960 --> 00:06:10,500
If you've got so much strength, then prove it to me

92
00:06:10,500 --> 00:06:11,340
Hmm

93
00:06:11,340 --> 00:06:14,340
You've taken up my blade in search of the demon's might

94
00:06:14,340 --> 00:06:15,740
The question is why

95
00:06:15,740 --> 00:06:17,280
I want revenge

96
00:06:17,280 --> 00:06:19,680
Because you've lost someone important to you?

97
00:06:20,060 --> 00:06:20,680
That's right

98
00:06:20,680 --> 00:06:23,880
I lost the only family I ever had

99
00:06:23,880 --> 00:06:25,100
That must have been difficult

100
00:06:25,100 --> 00:06:26,580
Very well then

101
00:06:26,580 --> 00:06:29,520
I can see the desire for revenge burning inside you

102
00:06:29,520 --> 00:06:32,240
I can offer you unlimited power to achieve it

103
00:06:32,240 --> 00:06:32,720
Yes

104
00:06:32,720 --> 00:06:34,980
But it's not quite that simple

105
00:06:34,980 --> 00:06:36,120
Sorry, you

106
00:06:36,120 --> 00:06:41,660
To get our strength

107
00:06:41,660 --> 00:06:45,600
You'll have to give yourself over and succumb to your desire for vengeance

108
00:06:45,600 --> 00:06:48,220
Your unjustly murdered friend is right

109
00:06:48,220 --> 00:06:51,680
I'd have to possess you to give you the kind of power you want

110
00:06:51,680 --> 00:06:52,960
No, wait!

111
00:06:56,260 --> 00:06:56,780
You

112
00:06:56,780 --> 00:07:06,720
You're not gonna run off and ditch us again, are you?

113
00:07:07,180 --> 00:07:09,280
You can't just abandon your family

114
00:07:09,280 --> 00:07:12,720
Brother, you would never do something so dumb

115
00:07:12,720 --> 00:07:17,020
Now that we're reunited, say you'll live here with us forever

116
00:07:17,020 --> 00:07:19,140
Yeah, stay with us, we miss you

117
00:07:19,140 --> 00:07:21,740
Ah, there it is

118
00:07:21,740 --> 00:07:22,700
Your weakness

119
00:07:22,700 --> 00:07:25,440
You have love in your heart and that's what's holding you back

120
00:07:25,440 --> 00:07:27,120
We worship desire

121
00:07:27,120 --> 00:07:29,160
We can't stand love

122
00:07:29,160 --> 00:07:30,220
Yoichi

123
00:07:30,220 --> 00:07:31,580
Kimizuki

124
00:07:31,580 --> 00:07:32,760
Shinoa

125
00:07:32,760 --> 00:07:34,480
Your new friends

126
00:07:34,480 --> 00:07:35,980
Forget about them

127
00:07:35,980 --> 00:07:39,400
You can't become a champion of revenge if you're worried about others

128
00:07:39,400 --> 00:07:42,040
But my friends

129
00:07:42,040 --> 00:07:46,180
Don't you think it's unfair that we're dead and you're making a new family?

130
00:07:46,180 --> 00:07:48,800
You left us behind and now you've moved on

131
00:07:48,800 --> 00:07:51,460
Going to school, training, and making new friends

132
00:07:51,460 --> 00:07:54,660
You've almost managed to completely forget about us, haven't you?

133
00:07:54,920 --> 00:07:55,680
I have not!

134
00:07:56,020 --> 00:07:57,020
I've never forgotten!

135
00:07:57,680 --> 00:08:00,040
Then forget your new friends and stay with us

136
00:08:00,040 --> 00:08:02,580
Remember, we're the only family you've ever had

137
00:08:02,580 --> 00:08:03,780
Shut your mouth

138
00:08:03,780 --> 00:08:06,920
It's the only way you'll get the strength to avenge us

139
00:08:06,920 --> 00:08:07,920
Stop it

140
00:08:07,920 --> 00:08:10,060
You're gonna submit yourself to revenge now

141
00:08:10,060 --> 00:08:11,200
Go to hell!

142
00:08:11,680 --> 00:08:13,600
Stop trying to confuse me, you bastard!

143
00:08:14,940 --> 00:08:17,540
I don't just need your strength to get revenge

144
00:08:17,540 --> 00:08:19,820
There's more to it

145
00:08:19,820 --> 00:08:21,660
My aim is bigger

146
00:08:21,660 --> 00:08:25,280
I want enough power to protect everything and everyone!

147
00:08:25,280 --> 00:08:33,160
This is the trouble with humans

148
00:08:33,160 --> 00:08:35,660
Your emotions are too complicated

149
00:08:35,660 --> 00:08:38,300
Love for your friends and fear for their safety

150
00:08:38,300 --> 00:08:40,760
Compete against your desire for revenge

151
00:08:40,760 --> 00:08:44,420
I like you

152
00:08:44,420 --> 00:08:45,960
Your spirit is strong

153
00:08:45,960 --> 00:08:49,060
I'll agree to follow you as long as it stays that way

154
00:08:49,060 --> 00:08:52,180
But if I detect weakness in your heart for even a moment

155
00:08:52,180 --> 00:08:54,040
I'll take over your body and soul

156
00:08:54,040 --> 00:08:56,120
All right, I guess that's fair

157
00:08:56,120 --> 00:08:58,600
My name is Ashura Maru

158
00:08:58,600 --> 00:09:01,460
If you need power, all you have to do is call for me

159
00:09:01,460 --> 00:09:02,520
Ashura Maru?

160
00:09:02,960 --> 00:09:04,980
Oh, and since you're going to be my master

161
00:09:04,980 --> 00:09:07,840
Let me give you some insider information as a gift

162
00:09:07,840 --> 00:09:08,640
Information?

163
00:09:09,520 --> 00:09:11,880
There's something odd about your composition

164
00:09:11,880 --> 00:09:16,700
You appear to be human, but about 10% of you is something different

165
00:09:16,700 --> 00:09:20,260
Could the humans be doing strange experiments on you or something?

166
00:09:20,560 --> 00:09:20,780
Huh?

167
00:09:21,440 --> 00:09:22,600
What are you talking about?

168
00:09:22,600 --> 00:09:24,680
You shouldn't trust your own kind

169
00:09:24,680 --> 00:09:29,720
Believe me when I tell you mankind is more devious than vampires and demons combined

170
00:09:29,720 --> 00:09:33,560
Though, it does feel a little weird saying that to a human

171
00:09:33,560 --> 00:09:35,680
Wait, explain yourself

172
00:09:35,680 --> 00:09:37,020
What are you suggesting?

173
00:09:37,020 --> 00:09:45,540
Very well

174
00:09:45,540 --> 00:09:47,400
Contract is now complete

175
00:09:47,400 --> 00:09:50,680
From this day forward, I shall lend you my strength and abilities

176
00:09:50,680 --> 00:09:52,700
Open your eyes

177
00:09:52,700 --> 00:09:55,260
Fan the flames of desire that burn inside of you

178
00:09:55,260 --> 00:09:57,600
And forge a blood-stained path in this world

179
00:09:57,600 --> 00:10:06,800
You're awake

180
00:10:06,800 --> 00:10:08,460
How you feelin', you?

181
00:10:09,000 --> 00:10:09,600
I'm okay

182
00:10:09,600 --> 00:10:15,900
I beat the demon

183
00:10:15,900 --> 00:10:17,740
I wouldn't get too cocky

184
00:10:17,740 --> 00:10:20,480
You took your sweet time subjugating the damn thing

185
00:10:20,480 --> 00:10:25,620
You got a cursed deer too?

186
00:10:26,500 --> 00:10:27,500
Of course I did

187
00:10:27,500 --> 00:10:29,980
And Yoichi?

188
00:10:29,980 --> 00:10:58,560
So then, who are you?

189
00:10:58,560 --> 00:11:01,720
You're the one who called me, Yoichi

190
00:11:01,720 --> 00:11:06,540
If you want to avenge your sister's death, you need a strong set of cursed gear to wield

191
00:11:06,540 --> 00:11:07,620
Oh, that's right

192
00:11:07,620 --> 00:11:11,360
I picked up a weapon and was going to make a contract with...

193
00:11:11,360 --> 00:11:12,400
I see

194
00:11:12,400 --> 00:11:14,000
That's what you are

195
00:11:14,000 --> 00:11:14,560
A demon

196
00:11:14,560 --> 00:11:16,300
That's right

197
00:11:16,300 --> 00:11:19,180
It's pretty mean you chose to look like this

198
00:11:19,180 --> 00:11:21,360
Just wait until you see my true form

199
00:11:21,360 --> 00:11:23,820
Yeah, I bet it's pretty nasty

200
00:11:23,820 --> 00:11:26,840
So, it seems we have a bit of a problem

201
00:11:26,840 --> 00:11:27,420
Huh?

202
00:11:27,860 --> 00:11:29,460
I've poured over your heart and soul

203
00:11:29,460 --> 00:11:33,180
You want to strike back at those who hurt you, but that desire is too weak

204
00:11:33,180 --> 00:11:37,420
Your soul is gentle

205
00:11:37,420 --> 00:11:38,540
And kind

206
00:11:38,540 --> 00:11:40,640
You have great love for others

207
00:11:40,640 --> 00:11:43,480
These are all qualities that I despise

208
00:11:43,480 --> 00:11:45,400
Wait, maybe you should look deeper

209
00:11:45,400 --> 00:11:47,400
Cause I do want to avenge my sister

210
00:11:47,400 --> 00:11:48,720
You lie

211
00:11:48,720 --> 00:11:52,400
In fact, the strongest feeling you have is the relief that you survived the attack

212
00:11:52,400 --> 00:11:53,960
No, that's not true

213
00:11:53,960 --> 00:11:57,080
Not to mention, you'd make a terrible fighter

214
00:11:57,080 --> 00:11:58,740
You're afraid of conflict

215
00:11:58,740 --> 00:12:01,100
And the thought of your friends and family getting hurt

216
00:12:01,100 --> 00:12:02,300
You're weak

217
00:12:02,300 --> 00:12:04,520
You don't have the courage to take a life

218
00:12:04,520 --> 00:12:07,900
How are you supposed to get revenge if you aren't capable of killing?

219
00:12:10,480 --> 00:12:12,700
What I really mean is you're a coward

220
00:12:12,700 --> 00:12:15,500
Just a child without a backbone

221
00:12:15,500 --> 00:12:16,820
A weakling

222
00:12:16,820 --> 00:12:45,940
You don't have the guts to fight for your life

223
00:12:45,940 --> 00:12:48,160
You wouldn't make a suitable master

224
00:12:48,160 --> 00:12:51,280
You're the most pathetic human being I've ever met

225
00:12:51,280 --> 00:13:05,560
Oh man, this is not good

226
00:13:05,560 --> 00:13:12,580
Looks like Yoichi didn't have the strength to overcome possession

227
00:13:12,580 --> 00:13:16,240
But I guess having two out of three students pass the Black Demon tryout

228
00:13:16,240 --> 00:13:17,340
Isn't that bad at all

229
00:13:17,340 --> 00:13:18,100
Huh?

230
00:13:18,600 --> 00:13:19,880
Hey, wait, where'd he go?

231
00:13:20,380 --> 00:13:20,700
One

232
00:13:20,700 --> 00:13:21,640
Two

233
00:13:21,640 --> 00:13:22,680
Three

234
00:13:22,680 --> 00:13:25,280
Four little humans all for me

235
00:13:25,280 --> 00:13:27,760
Dammit, but they've each got cursed gears too

236
00:13:27,760 --> 00:13:30,800
Power-hungry humans are such a pain in the ass

237
00:13:30,800 --> 00:13:32,920
My bow

238
00:13:32,920 --> 00:13:35,020
All right

239
00:13:35,020 --> 00:13:37,600
Now that you two have both got your cursed gear

240
00:13:37,600 --> 00:13:39,460
It's time for your first mission

241
00:13:39,460 --> 00:13:42,520
There's a human-eating demon loose somewhere in this room

242
00:13:42,520 --> 00:13:44,580
You, Kimizuki

243
00:13:44,580 --> 00:13:47,500
It's up to you guys to deal with it

244
00:13:47,500 --> 00:13:49,740
Show that bastard who's in control

245
00:13:49,740 --> 00:13:51,900
They'll be my appetizers

246
00:13:51,900 --> 00:13:54,240
Then the real feast will begin

247
00:13:54,240 --> 00:13:56,140
Yoichi!

248
00:13:56,140 --> 00:14:13,480
Well, great

249
00:14:13,480 --> 00:14:16,380
Looks like this demon is coming at us with full force

250
00:14:16,380 --> 00:14:19,060
Yoichi must have just been a snack to whet its appetite

251
00:14:19,060 --> 00:14:19,960
Lieutenant Colonel

252
00:14:19,960 --> 00:14:21,960
May I share my opinion?

253
00:14:22,160 --> 00:14:22,660
Please, no

254
00:14:22,660 --> 00:14:23,600
Quiet

255
00:14:23,600 --> 00:14:26,100
The situation's getting out of control

256
00:14:26,100 --> 00:14:27,160
Hey, Gurren!

257
00:14:27,760 --> 00:14:29,320
How are we supposed to deal with this?

258
00:14:31,940 --> 00:14:33,460
Yoichi is still one of us

259
00:14:33,460 --> 00:14:34,440
Look at him

260
00:14:34,440 --> 00:14:36,680
Your classmate's body assist a vessel now

261
00:14:36,680 --> 00:14:39,140
The only way to save Yoichi is to destroy it

262
00:14:39,140 --> 00:14:40,380
What the hell, man?

263
00:14:41,640 --> 00:14:43,860
There's no way I'm gonna kill one of my friends

264
00:14:43,860 --> 00:14:46,760
Don't you get soft on me

265
00:14:46,760 --> 00:14:48,520
This is the Moon Demon Company

266
00:14:48,520 --> 00:14:50,840
Extermination is your job

267
00:14:50,840 --> 00:14:52,520
Or are you guys all talking

268
00:14:52,520 --> 00:14:54,300
Just here to play around with cursed gear

269
00:14:54,300 --> 00:14:56,840
If you want to get killed, that's on you

270
00:14:56,840 --> 00:14:58,820
But that monster's not your friend anymore

271
00:14:58,820 --> 00:15:00,000
Damn it

272
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:05,240
If you're serious about using those weapons

273
00:15:05,240 --> 00:15:08,000
Then show me you've got what it takes to be a soldier

274
00:15:08,000 --> 00:15:09,260
Damn it, Yoichi

275
00:15:09,260 --> 00:15:10,960
Sorry, but

276
00:15:10,960 --> 00:15:14,180
You're going down!

277
00:15:14,180 --> 00:15:18,640
What the hell was that?

278
00:15:18,640 --> 00:15:18,880
You!

